<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Devices that make Nunchuk an option when a USB device is attached. Ledger's USB vendor id
    is 0x2c97; this file takes decimal, so 11415. No product-id, so every Ledger model matches
    (Nano S / S Plus / X / Stax / Flex differ only by product id) and a device still matches
    after it re-enumerates on an app switch.

    Keep in sync with LedgerBleController.LEDGER_USB_VENDOR_ID, which decides what reaches the
    device picker: a vendor listed in only one of the two shows up in the picker but isn't
    offered on plug-in, or the reverse. Only add a vendor the app can actually drive — over USB
    it speaks the Ledger protocol alone, so anything else would connect and then fail.
-->
<resources>
    <usb-device vendor-id="11415" />
</resources>
